<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA V INDIA SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA V INDIA SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard at the end of Sri</p>
<p>Lanka's first innings on the second day of the second and final</p>
<p>test match against India on Sunday.</p>
<p>SRI LANKA 1st innings (overnight 316 for 7)</p>
<p> S.Jayasuriya c Tendulkar b Mohanty	     32</p>
<p> M.Atapattu c Azharuddin b Prasad		 19</p>
<p> R.Mahanama c Azharuddin b Mohanty		37</p>
<p> A.de Silva c Mongia b Mohanty		   146</p>
<p> A.Ranatunga c Mongia b Ganguly		   14</p>
<p> M.Jayawardena c Mongia b Prasad		  16</p>
<p> R.Kaluwitharana b Kuruvilla			 7</p>
<p> C.Vaas b Kuruvilla				   10</p>
<p> M.Muralitharan c Azharuddin by Kumble	  39</p>
<p> R.Pushpakumara b Mohanty			    0</p>
<p> S.de Silva not out				    0</p>
<p> Extras (B-4, LB-4, NB-4)			   12</p>
<p> Total (all out, 95.4 overs)		     332</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-53, 2-59, 3-121, 4-192, 5-230, 6-249,</p>
<p>7-274, 8-322, 9-332, 10-332</p>
<p>Bowling: Prasad 26-5-104-2 (1nb); Kuruvilla 20-5-68-2</p>
<p>(1nb); Mohanty 20.4-5-78-4; Kumble 25-8-51-1 (2nb); Ganguly</p>
<p>4-0-23-1.</p>
<p>India: S.Tendulkar (captain), S.Ganguly, N.Sidhu, R.Dravid,</p>
<p>M.Azharuddin, A.jadeja, N.Mongia, A.Kumble, A.Kuruvilla,</p>
<p>V.Prasad, D.Mohanty.</p>
